## ⚙️ 自动化规则

### 告警规则

```json
{
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "重大战略动态",
      "conditions": {
        "keywords": ["收购", "并购", "融资", "上市", "战略合作"],
        "priority": "critical",
        "channels": ["news", "official"]
      },
      "action": "immediate_alert"
    },
    {
      "name": "产品发布",
      "conditions": {
        "keywords": ["发布", "上市", "获批", "注册"],
        "priority": "high",
        "channels": ["news", "official"]
      },
      "action": "daily_digest"
    },
    {
      "name": "招投标中标",
      "conditions": {
        "keywords": ["中标", "成交"],
        "priority": "high",
        "channels": ["bid"]
      },
      "action": "daily_digest"
    },
    {
      "name": "专利申请",
      "conditions": {
        "type": "patent",
        "priority": "medium",
        "channels": ["patent"]
      },
      "action": "weekly_digest"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### 去重规则

```json
{
  "deduplication": {
    "enabled": true,
    "window_hours": 24,
    "similarity_threshold": 0.85,
    "keep_highest_confidence": true
  }
}
```

---

### 置信度自动评级

```json
{
  "confidence_auto_rating": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "source_type": "official",
        "content_type": "announcement",
        "confidence": "A"
      },
      {
        "source_type": "news",
        "source_tier": 1,
        "confidence": "B"
      },
      {
        "source_type": "news",
        "source_tier": 2,
        "confidence": "C"
      },
      {
        "source_type": "social",
        "verified": true,
        "confidence": "C"
      },
      {
        "source_type": "social",
        "verified": false,
        "confidence": "D"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

